<%# locals: (task:, labelled: nil, options_on_page: nil) %>
<%# Who's on a task, changed in place (Fizzy's assignments): the avatars (or an empty circle) open
    the page's one list of the team beside them (task_picker_menus: a ui :combobox with no trigger
    of its own, opened by data-runeui-open). Type to narrow it; each pick puts that person on or
    takes them off, and the list stays open. The first on leads (the owner); taking off the lead
    hands it to whoever came on next. A row carries only its avatars. %>
<% unless options_on_page %>
  <%= task_picker_menus %>
<% end %>
<span class="row-picker owner-picker" id="<%= dom_id(task, labelled ? :owner_labelled : :owner) %>" data-controller="picker" data-picker-kind-value="owners"
  data-picker-current-value="<%= task.owners.map(&:id).join(",") %>" data-picker-menu-value="task-owner-menu" data-picker-form-value="task-owner-form"
  data-picker-url-value="<%= task_assignments_path(task) %>" data-picker-due-value="<%= task.due_on&.iso8601 %>"<% if labelled %> data-picker-labelled-value="true"<% end %>>
  <%= render "tasks/owners", task: task, labelled: labelled %>
</span>
